{"productId": "a3a2dfae-43bc-4cad-8490-3cbbf3782c29", "modelName": "Elite Hunter", "modelDescription": "Berger Elite Hunter bullets are made with the longest possible Hybrid ogive (nose). Elite Hunters utilize the same industry-leading Hybrid ogive as our Hybrid Target bullets, the #1 choice of nearly every competitive long range shooting discipline, but with a thinner J4 Jacket that allows rapid expansion on game. Hybrid Ogives have a very aggressive VLD style shape towards the tip of the bullet, but transform into a traditional tangent shape closer to the bearing surface, allowing for higher BCs while still being very easy to tune and much less sensitivity to seating depth. The long-nosed hybrid profile that the Elite Hunter projectiles are designed with produce the highest possible Ballistic Coefficients in an easy to load and shoot bullet. As a result, when loading this bullet into Berger Ammunition we are able to get results that are on par with hand loads when it comes to accuracy and performance.", "manufacturerName": "Berger Bullets", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": false, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "0eebec27-58ad-4967-95ba-9357edd9a1ed", "description": "Berger Bullets, Elite Hunter, 300 PRC, 205  Grain, Boat Tail Hollow Point, 20 Round Box", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/20f48716-9aac-49b8-8c20-da402c3a6219"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "55010", "upc": "679459642101", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "44b60848-4d21-40b2-8cd8-9b93f1ad4e10", "attributeName": "Rounds Per Box", "attributeValueId": "78df7061-2865-4b2a-a464-da94c39ce69d", "valueName": "20"}, {"attributeNameId": "122db9af-159a-4def-bad8-7dd97ebe5097", "attributeName": "Bullet Grain Weight", "attributeValueId": "0d943e4d-4e50-4d49-b815-f692e7c99ca8", "valueName": "205 Grains"}, {"attributeNameId": "f3f25879-1643-4efe-812a-a88e863819dd", "attributeName": "Rifle Caliber", "attributeValueId": "fde899eb-7cd5-4a90-ad8e-f3ac2fcc0f22", "valueName"